{"data":{"featured":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"JJ’s Deliveries","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/d7305d75c180478301e5d23b94e88ac5/16bc0/jjs.png","srcSet":"/static/d7305d75c180478301e5d23b94e88ac5/d8ee9/jjs.png 175w,\n/static/d7305d75c180478301e5d23b94e88ac5/5c755/jjs.png 350w,\n/static/d7305d75c180478301e5d23b94e88ac5/16bc0/jjs.png 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/d7305d75c180478301e5d23b94e88ac5/ea096/jjs.avif 175w,\n/static/d7305d75c180478301e5d23b94e88ac5/758bc/jjs.avif 350w,\n/static/d7305d75c180478301e5d23b94e88ac5/23e81/jjs.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/d7305d75c180478301e5d23b94e88ac5/93fe5/jjs.webp 175w,\n/static/d7305d75c180478301e5d23b94e88ac5/a9c60/jjs.webp 350w,\n/static/d7305d75c180478301e5d23b94e88ac5/e1299/jjs.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":525}}},"tech":["Flutter","Laravel","Firebase","Google Maps"],"github":null,"external":null,"cta":"https://play.google.com/store/apps/developer?id=JJ%27s+Deliveries"},"html":"<p>JJ’s Deliveries is a complete food delivery marketplace connecting customers, restaurants, and delivery drivers through three interconnected applications powered by a unified backend. It features real-time delivery tracking with optimized driver assignment logic, Google Maps integration for live location tracking, routing, and distance calculations. Structured data modeling helped reduce Firebase read and write costs by 60%, while consistent UI/UX across all applications improves onboarding and user engagement. The platform also supports scalable backend synchronization across all user roles.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Bazaar App","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/eabf496fabdb29fd56cfbd9f674c090f/16bc0/bazaar.png","srcSet":"/static/eabf496fabdb29fd56cfbd9f674c090f/d8ee9/bazaar.png 175w,\n/static/eabf496fabdb29fd56cfbd9f674c090f/5c755/bazaar.png 350w,\n/static/eabf496fabdb29fd56cfbd9f674c090f/16bc0/bazaar.png 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/eabf496fabdb29fd56cfbd9f674c090f/ea096/bazaar.avif 175w,\n/static/eabf496fabdb29fd56cfbd9f674c090f/758bc/bazaar.avif 350w,\n/static/eabf496fabdb29fd56cfbd9f674c090f/23e81/bazaar.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/eabf496fabdb29fd56cfbd9f674c090f/93fe5/bazaar.webp 175w,\n/static/eabf496fabdb29fd56cfbd9f674c090f/a9c60/bazaar.webp 350w,\n/static/eabf496fabdb29fd56cfbd9f674c090f/e1299/bazaar.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":525}}},"tech":["Flutter","Node.js","MongoDB","REST APIs","GetX","WebSockets","Stripe","CI/CD"],"github":null,"external":null,"cta":"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.analytica.bazaarECommerce&hl=en"},"html":"<p>Bazaar App is a large-scale, UAE-based multi-category e-commerce marketplace serving thousands of daily shoppers. It features a scalable product architecture with dynamic variants and inventory management, advanced discount logic, and personalized product recommendations. The application supports deep linking for seamless navigation, WebSocket-based real-time order updates, and secure Stripe checkout integration. Advanced caching and performance profiling also helped improve application loading time by 35%.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Luminate","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/907936315cb0cfe310d899e8820cc889/d2194/luminate.png","srcSet":"/static/907936315cb0cfe310d899e8820cc889/cebcc/luminate.png 175w,\n/static/907936315cb0cfe310d899e8820cc889/272cf/luminate.png 350w,\n/static/907936315cb0cfe310d899e8820cc889/d2194/luminate.png 700w,\n/static/907936315cb0cfe310d899e8820cc889/b50c4/luminate.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/907936315cb0cfe310d899e8820cc889/9aa63/luminate.avif 175w,\n/static/907936315cb0cfe310d899e8820cc889/e6db6/luminate.avif 350w,\n/static/907936315cb0cfe310d899e8820cc889/f47db/luminate.avif 700w,\n/static/907936315cb0cfe310d899e8820cc889/8fee6/luminate.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/907936315cb0cfe310d899e8820cc889/240e7/luminate.webp 175w,\n/static/907936315cb0cfe310d899e8820cc889/faefe/luminate.webp 350w,\n/static/907936315cb0cfe310d899e8820cc889/d5dc4/luminate.webp 700w,\n/static/907936315cb0cfe310d899e8820cc889/e2f1a/luminate.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":438}}},"tech":["Flutter","GetX","Clean Architecture","REST APIs","CI/CD","Jenkins"],"github":null,"external":null,"cta":"https://www.luminatemed.com/"},"html":"<p>Luminate is a telehealth appointment platform that enables patients to book video consultations based on doctors' available time slots. It features reusable booking and slot-selection interfaces for browsing doctor availability, secure video consultation workflows for patient–doctor sessions, and REST API integrations for managing doctor and patient schedules. The application follows Clean Architecture with GetX to ensure maintainable and testable modules, while Jenkins CI/CD automates builds, testing, and deployment.</p>"}}]}}}